abstract: >-
  An experimental interoperability resolver, profile contract and reference implementation
  for discovering and routing the human-readable, machine-readable, retrieval, API, tool,
  agent and trust surfaces exposed by public websites. ARWP preserves discovery provenance,
  reports conflicts, distinguishes static declarations from runtime evidence and maintains
  evidence-backed benchmarks, protocol observations and citation-oriented project surfaces.
